cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use crprune in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: crprune
abstract: >-
  crprune deletes old images from Azure Container Registry and GitHub
  Container Registry (ghcr.io) by declarative JSON retention rules, without
  breaking the images it keeps: multi-platform images, OCI referrers and
  cosign signatures stay with the image they belong to.
authors:
  - given-names: Johan
    family-names: Lindvall
repository-code: https://github.com/JohanLindvall/crprune
url: https://github.com/JohanLindvall/crprune
license: MIT
keywords:
  - container registry
  - Azure Container Registry
  - GitHub Container Registry
  - OCI
  - retention policy
  - cleanup
